## Optional JOG / kiosk environment (FOG runs natively under /opt/fog — not Docker).
##
## Native FOG install:
##   sudo ./install/fog-native-install.sh
##
## Pin FOG Git branch/tag when cloning (defaults to GitHub default branch):
# FOG_GIT_REF=1.5.10.2518   # pinned; set FOG_GIT_COMMIT with it (see install/fog-native-install.sh)
